  "notes": "1 mono and 2 stereo channels, 2-band EQ, no phantom power, no monitor outputs and no FX send (from the panel drawing and controls description). Each mono channel has MIC and LINE IN, but only one can be used at a time. USB (type B, stereo in/out) plays on the last stereo channel until a jack is plugged in there. MAIN OUT is impedance-balanced 6.35 mm TRS, PHONES unbalanced TRS, STREAM IN/OUT are RCA. Routing lists where a signal can go; knobs and STREAM buttons decide what actually reaches an output. DC power input not listed.",
